## Implementation Details
The Analytics component is placed inside the main App component after all Routes, which ensures:
1. Analytics tracking is active across all routes
2. The component is rendered once at the application root level
3. Page views and interactions are automatically tracked

## Next Steps
The analytics implementation is complete and follows Vercel's latest documentation (fetched from https://vercel.com/docs/analytics/quickstart). To activate tracking:

1. Ensure the project is deployed to Vercel
2. Enable Web Analytics in the Vercel dashboard under the Analytics tab
3. Deploy the application using `vercel deploy`

Once deployed, analytics data will automatically start being collected and displayed in the Vercel dashboard.

